update content_bodies set title = '【ヨロン島】守ってほしい！海のマナー', description = 'この動画は、南国の楽園ヨロン島のマナーについて紹介しています。ヨロン島を訪れることは、ヨロンファミリーの一員になることを意味し、美しい海や海の生き物、島の人々を家族のように大切にすることが求められます。訪れる人々には、優しい気持ちで旅をし、環境を尊重することが奨励されています。出演は与論島劇団 野性の島人で、制作は81plus株式会社です。' where id = 'mbWfLJWy9x2WZO8Y2sYG0';
update content_bodies set title = 'Yoron Island Etiquette - Beach Edition', description = 'This video highlights the etiquette of Yoron Island, a tropical paradise. Traveling to Yoron Island means becoming part of the Yoron family, where the beautiful sea, marine life, and local people are cherished like family. Visitors are encouraged to travel with a kind heart and respect for the environment. The video features the Yoron Island Theater Group, Wild Islanders, and is produced by 81plus Inc.' where id = 'fc2Ye8oaP4RbJj68YJR_m';
update content_bodies set title = 'KEEP THE ISLAND YORON', description = 'ヨロン島を訪れる旅行者向けに、観光マナーや島の風習、楽しみ方を紹介するガイドです。' where id = 'NJMEr7V9rXscdjsz4zq7o';
update content_bodies set title = 'KEEP THE ISLAND YORON', description = 'This guide provides information on tourism etiquette, local customs, and ways to enjoy Yoron Island for travelers visiting the island.' where id = 'ygi_Fp19LxtUVXMz2lhsE';
update content_bodies set title = '三重県初！綺麗な海と空を眺めながら乗馬ができる施設🐎🌊 #kankomie #旅行 #三重 #観光三重', description = '「ビーチライドコース」では、スタッフが手綱を引いてくれるため、未経験者でも安心して楽しむことができます。さらに、経験者向けの「海ライド」など、初心者から上級者まで楽しめるメニューが豊富に用意されています。開放感あふれる海での乗馬は、最高の思い出になること間違いなしです。施設は三重県津市の「海の乗馬倶楽部 エルカバージョ」にあり、営業時間は9:00～17:00、火曜日は定休日です。駐車場は20台分あり、「ビーチライド」は30分で13,200円、保険料440円が別途必要で、エアバックベストのレンタル料は1,650円です。対象は中学生以上、体重75kg以下の方で、伊勢自動車道「芸濃IC」から車で約24分の距離です。' where id = 's7ZXJ6NSVHlrhcm9n4G6Q';
update content_bodies set title = 'First in Mie! A facility where you can enjoy horseback riding while gazing at the beautiful sea and sky 🐎🌊 #kankomie #travel #Mie #tourismMie', description = 'The ''Beach Ride Course'' offers a safe experience for beginners, as staff will guide the reins. There are plenty of options for all skill levels, including ''Sea Ride'' for experienced riders. Riding horses in the open sea is sure to create unforgettable memories. Located at ''Umino Horse Riding Club El Caballo'' in Tsu City, Mie Prefecture, the facility operates from 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM, closed on Tuesdays. Parking is available for 20 cars. The ''Beach Ride'' costs 13,200 yen for 30 minutes, with an additional insurance fee of 440 yen and a mandatory airbag vest rental fee of 1,650 yen. Suitable for individuals aged 13 and older, weighing up to 75 kg. Access is approximately 24 minutes by car from the Ise Expressway ''Geino IC''.' where id = 'kglF4_C1XWP5Lxs7rGR54';
update content_bodies set title = '河内渓谷の紅葉ライトアップ❕✨ #紅葉', description = '11月25日（日）まで、夜間ライトアップが行われます。ライトアップの時間は17：00〜21：00です。美しいアーチの忍田橋と色鮮やかな紅葉が絶景を作り出し、毎年津市の紅葉名所として人気のスポットです。撮影日は11月22日で、紅葉は見ごろを迎えていました。紅葉の色づき情報は「錫杖湖水荘」のInstagramをチェックしてください。場所は三重県津市芸濃町雲林院107で、鑑賞は無料、駐車場も無料です。伊勢自動車道「芸濃IC」から車で約20分のアクセスです。' where id = 'O7yntbvMmlKmt6PUqxJg8';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kawachi Valley Autumn Leaves Light Up❕✨ #AutumnLeaves', description = 'Until November 25 (Sunday), there will be a night illumination from 17:00 to 21:00. The beautiful arch of Nindabashi and the vibrant autumn leaves create a stunning view, making it a popular spot for autumn foliage in Tsu City every year. The shooting date was November 22, when the leaves were at their peak. For updates on the autumn foliage colors, check the Instagram of ''Shakujoko Suiso'' @tsu_shakujokosuisou. Location: Kawachi Valley, Mie Prefecture, Tsu City, Geino Town, Unrin-in 107. Admission is free, and there is free parking available. Access is about 20 minutes by car from the Ise Expressway ''Geino IC''.' where id = 'hciCZrcGJFLqNWdnRTg16';
update content_bodies set title = '南阿蘇村PV 2022', description = '南阿蘇村は、世界最大級の阿蘇カルデラの南麓に位置し、「水の生まれる郷」として知られています。豊かな湧水に恵まれた農作物や、田園風景を走る南阿蘇鉄道、様々な泉質の温泉、千年以上続く放牧地の草原とあか牛など、ここでしか味わえない魅力が満載です。ぜひ、南阿蘇村を訪れ、360°の絶景を五感で体験してみてください。' where id = 'TfwbHmzrlzskAS0UzbGbO';
update content_bodies set title = 'Minamiaso Village PV 2022', description = 'Minamiaso Village is located at the southern foot of the Aso caldera, one of the largest in the world, and is known as a ''hometown of water.'' The village is rich in natural springs that nourish abundant agricultural products, features the scenic Minamiaso Railway, and offers various hot springs with diverse mineral qualities. Additionally, it has grasslands that have been used for grazing for over a thousand years, home to the unique Akabuu cattle. Visitors are encouraged to experience the breathtaking 360° views and the unique charm of Minamiaso Village with their own senses.' where id = 'Ju2U-SktVDxwuO-fOMcW1';
update content_bodies set title = 'a letter from 〜島に結う〜', description = 'この動画は「a letter from 〜島に結う〜」について紹介しています。' where id = '82Hj3p6y2U8VcorhA9ZEV';
