update content_bodies set title = '蹴鞠_KEMARI　日本のサッカー in 京都', description = '京都府の中部、京丹波町で体験できる「蹴鞠」は、1400年以上の歴史を持つ日本の伝統的なスポーツです。蹴鞠に欠かせない道具は「鹿革鞠」で、京丹波の美女山の里にいる唯一の鞠師が、昔ながらの製法で製作しています。鞠足として40年の経験を持つ池田游達氏が、実演を交えながら「蹴鞠の真髄」を語ります。京都の文化を楽しく体験し、生涯スポーツとしての蹴鞠を楽しむことができます。' where id = 'dW8XPkLk9Py1Me1JgcjGH';
update content_bodies set title = 'KEMARI: Japanese Football in Kyoto', description = 'In Kyotanba Town, located in the central part of Kyoto Prefecture, you can experience KEMARI, a traditional Japanese sport that has been cherished for over 1,400 years. An essential tool for KEMARI is the ''shika-kawa mari'' (deer leather ball), which is crafted using traditional methods by the only remaining ball maker in the area, who resides in the Bijoyama region of Kyotanba. Mr. Yutaka Ikeda, with 40 years of experience as a KEMARI player, will share the essence of KEMARI through demonstrations. This offers a fun way to engage with Kyoto''s culture and enjoy KEMARI as a lifelong sport.' where id = '7nu4ttNP0mOR-A8udWU3i';
